      "ref": "bow",
      "design": "Exactly6 traditional Korean recurved BOW AND QUIVER pairs. Identical orientation and size: bow on RIGHT of cell, upper limb at upper LEFT and lower limb lower RIGHT, curve bulges RIGHT and taut string on LEFT. Each identical cylindrical leather quiver stands on LEFT of its bow, open top, exactly3 feathered arrows protruding, same height and angle; vary only material/color, never quiver construction. Simple wood bow; jade-green bow; ivory-tipped horn bow; red gold bow; black horn bow; Baekje blue-gold royal bow."
    },
    {
      "key": "crossbows",
      "cols": 2,
      "rows": 2,
      "ids": [
        "crossbow",
        "bronze_crossbow",
        "heavy_crossbow",
