      ],
      "ref": "talisman",
      "design": "Exactly9 Korean ritual paper TALISMANS. ALL face STRAIGHT FRONT, identical upright narrow rectangular silhouette, equal width/height, straight hanging yellow/ivory paper, small gold capped rod top and bottom, small identical cord and tassels. Same exact frontal angle, NO rolled tube lying sideways and NO landscape hanging painting. Rich ornamental abstract ritual ink symbols, no legible writing. Color accents ordered: green herb; jade green; gold protection; red sun; blue rain; green wind; purple star; Baekje deep blue/gold phoenix ward; Goguryeo red/black/gold fortress ward. Vary colors/ornament only."
    },
