      "design": "Exactly8 small WRIST BRACELETS in first8 cells, last cell EMPTY. ALL share same three-quarter TOP-FRONT view with a horizontally elliptical opening (ellipse width1.45 times depth), same wrist-sized outer diameter and scale, sidewall visible on front lower half. Every bracelet is a complete closed loop, not a finger ring, not a necklace, not a cuff opened sideways. In order: gray stone bead bracelet with small cord knot; simple silver engraved bangle; bronze floral bangle; silver vine pearl bangle; amber bead bracelet; red garnet bead bracelet; solid jade bangle gold clasps; ornate gold dragon bangle. Bead bracelets form same ellipse and camera angle as metal bangles. NO loose long necklace string."
